# The repository already stores LF; this pins it so a Windows checkout can
# never commit CRLF back, and silences the "LF will be replaced by CRLF"
# warning on every add. The bot deploys to a Linux container, where LF is what
# the shebang-free entrypoint and the egg's shell commands expect anyway.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep the lockfile byte-identical to what npm writes.
package-lock.json -diff
